<title>CHINA: China Jan-June soybean and soymeal imports.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June soybean and soymeal imports.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 1.24 million tonnes of soybeans and 1.2 million tonnes of soymeal in January to June this year, the China Securities said on Wednesday, quoting customs figures.</p>
<p>Imports of soybeans in June alone were 112,298 tonnes and imports of soymeal were 51,487 tonnes, it said.</p>
<p>It gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
